WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.440
Three technologies have different
jobs. Containerization packages

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:07.200
and runs real software, such
as a database for one test run.

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:12.080
Service virtualization simulates selected
dependency behavior, such as a provider

00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:16.960
timeout. Contract testing checks whether
consumer and provider interactions agree.

00:00:17.088 --> 00:00:21.760
They complement one another but do not
establish complete business correctness.

00:00:21.886 --> 00:00:25.760
Choose supported tooling for the client
application, and retain separate

00:00:25.811 --> 00:00:29.920
strategies for mobile devices,
batch settlement and real integration.
